WEBVTT

00:10.160 --> 00:12.620
<b>The sea!</b>

00:14.370 --> 00:16.330
<b>Come on out, everyone!</b>

00:25.800 --> 00:29.010
<b>Waninoko, Hahakomori, Mokuroh{BEST BIRB}, 
 you okay?</b>

00:41.400 --> 00:44.940
<b>Hey, Heigani! 
 Come back!</b>

00:46.780 --> 00:49.780
<b>He must be happy to 
 be in the sea after so long.</b>

00:52.660 --> 00:54.780
<b>Satoshi and Pikachu’s journey...</b>

00:55.370 --> 00:57.750
<b>At a coast 
 with a salty sea breeze,</b>

00:57.750 --> 01:00.540
<b>what Pokémon 
 will they meet today?</b>

01:17.850 --> 01:19.020
<b>Pikachu?</b>

01:27.280 --> 01:28.650
<b>It’s an Udeppou!</b>

01:53.340 --> 01:57.390
<b>Udeppou. Water Gun Pokémon. 
 Water type.</b>

01:57.390 --> 02:00.180
<b>By detonating gas 
 that accumulates in its right claw,</b>

02:00.560 --> 02:03.640
<b>it launches water like a bullet 
 to defeat its enemies.{Shield dex entry, reformatted}</b>

02:20.540 --> 02:21.750
<b>He’s strong...</b>

02:21.750 --> 02:25.460
<b>I’ve decided! 
 I’m catching that Udeppou!</b>

02:28.460 --> 02:29.090
<b>What?</b>

02:32.630 --> 02:33.930
<b>Kasumi?!</b>

02:33.930 --> 02:36.260
<b>It’s been so long, Satoshi!</b>

