04:18.070 --> 04:20.700
<b><i>I’m</i> gonna catch that Udeppou!</b>

04:33.590 --> 04:36.420
<b>Aww... Couldn’t catch him.</b>

04:53.560 --> 04:55.730
<b>Pikachu! 
 It’s been so long!</b>

05:05.620 --> 05:07.540
<b>They all look happy!</b>

05:16.550 --> 05:18.340
<b>And so does Mokuroh{BEST BIRB}!</b>

05:19.470 --> 05:22.220
<b>I saw you on TV, 
 Champion!</b>

05:22.220 --> 05:23.220
<b>Congrats!</b>

05:23.220 --> 05:24.640
<b>Yeah! Thanks!</b>

05:24.640 --> 05:30.020
<b>When I saw you battling, 
 I just couldn’t sit still!</b>

05:30.020 --> 05:34.150
<b>So I left Hanada Gym to my sisters 
 and set out on a journey.</b>

05:34.150 --> 05:35.770
<b>You did, huh?</b>

05:39.650 --> 05:42.150
<b>What’s he doing?</b>

05:42.150 --> 05:44.200
<b>Maybe he’s calling Udeppou.</b>

05:44.200 --> 05:47.160
<b>I’m going to catch that Udeppou!</b>

05:47.160 --> 05:47.910
<b>Why?</b>

05:48.290 --> 05:52.370
<b>The two of us are linked together 
 by the red string{akai ito, the item localized as Destiny Knot (which I'd rather retranslate to Red String if it ever comes up). Either way, no need to take it as the item here, so no caps needed. - Toa} of fate!</b>

05:54.000 --> 05:55.960
<b>Fate...?</b>

05:57.000 --> 05:59.340
<b>After all, I...</b>

05:59.880 --> 06:03.890
<b>...fished him up with 
 my precious Kasumi Lure!</b>

06:12.020 --> 06:15.440
<b>The moment our eyes met 
 through the Water Gun,</b>

06:15.440 --> 06:17.230
<b>I felt a spark.</b>

06:19.530 --> 06:23.530
<b>We met again and again... 
 Could this be chance?</b>

06:23.530 --> 06:26.660
<b>No, it must be fate!</b>

06:26.660 --> 06:31.660
<b>I can tell! 
 That’s how he shows his love!</b>

06:34.580 --> 06:36.330
<b>You really think?</b>

06:38.210 --> 06:39.920
<b>Can’t you just find another one?</b>

06:39.920 --> 06:42.260
<b>No way! He’s the <i>one!</i></b>

06:42.260 --> 06:45.470
<b>Those eyes are so lovely... 
 So cool...</b>

06:47.260 --> 06:51.270
<b>My heart throbs like it’s 
 Aqua Breaking!</b>

06:51.270 --> 06:55.520
<b>But I decided 
 I’d catch that Udeppou, too.</b>

06:55.520 --> 06:58.270
<b>You can’t! 
 I found him first!</b>

06:58.270 --> 07:00.150
<b>My Heigani’s waiting!</b>

07:02.530 --> 07:04.320
<b>I can tell!</b>

07:04.320 --> 07:09.700
<b>The battle from before sparked 
 a deep friendship between Heigani and Udeppou!</b>

07:09.700 --> 07:10.490
<b>Huh?</b>

07:10.490 --> 07:13.410
<b>So I’ll catch him, 
 for Heigani!</b>

07:14.460 --> 07:16.460
<b>In that case...</b>

07:16.460 --> 07:18.080
<b>Let’s decide it by fishing!</b>

07:19.000 --> 07:21.170
<b>Just what I wanted!</b>

07:24.670 --> 07:26.180
<b>What’s <i>that?</i></b>

07:26.180 --> 07:29.430
<b>Huh? I got this from 
 a friend I traveled with.</b>

07:30.010 --> 07:32.310
<b>I gave you one of mine, 
 didn’t I?</b>

07:32.310 --> 07:34.600
<b>This one catches more fish.</b>

07:35.020 --> 07:36.810
<b>It’s better than <i>somebody’s</i> lure.</b>

07:37.900 --> 07:39.270
<b>Now you’ve done it!</b>

07:39.270 --> 07:41.730
<b>Let’s have a fishing battle!</b>

07:41.730 --> 07:43.940
<b>Hold it, Satoshi!</b>

07:50.870 --> 07:54.120
<b>Whoever fishes him up first 
 has the right to catch him.</b>

07:54.120 --> 07:56.290
<b>If they fail, 
 the other person gets a turn.</b>

07:56.290 --> 07:57.670
<b>I get it!</b>

07:59.880 --> 08:01.630
<b>Watch this, Heigani!</b>

08:01.630 --> 08:04.050
<b>I’m definitely gonna 
 catch that Udeppou!</b>

08:05.340 --> 08:06.880
<b>Ready? And...!</b>

08:25.400 --> 08:26.820
<b>He’s not biting...</b>

08:26.820 --> 08:28.280
<b>You’re so impatient.</b>

08:28.280 --> 08:31.030
<b>He’s not gonna bite so easily.</b>

08:31.030 --> 08:32.280
<b>You just have to wait.</b>

08:32.740 --> 08:36.250
<b>Well, that may be hard 
 for a loudmouth like Satoshi.</b>

08:36.250 --> 08:37.910
<b>You’re the bigger loudmouth.</b>

08:38.710 --> 08:41.040
<b>Hmm? You just say something?</b>

08:41.040 --> 08:42.460
<b>Wasn’t me!</b>

08:42.460 --> 08:43.790
<b>Yes it was!</b>

08:43.790 --> 08:46.090
<b>I could hear you perfectly!</b>

08:47.170 --> 08:49.180
<b>Huh? It’s the brat boy.</b>

08:49.680 --> 08:52.300
<b>And the original brat girl, meow.</b>

08:52.300 --> 08:55.390
<b>Huh? So what?</b>

08:56.310 --> 08:58.480
<b>I’m starving...</b>

09:00.480 --> 09:03.150
<b>That’s it! Needs must 
 when the stomach drives.{bleh. The idiom used is 背に腹は代えられない ~= 'needs must when the devil drives'/'a small sacrifice may be necessary to solve a more pressing problem', lit. 'a back can't replace a stomach' (meaning: a wound taken to the back is less deadly than one to the front -> something less important can't replace something really important), probably said here because 'stomach' is in the idiom, but can't find anything similarly stomach-y for English. Musashi uses the JP idiom as-is without any twist.}</b>

09:03.150 --> 09:05.780
<b>We’ve gotta catch their food!</b>

09:05.780 --> 09:09.700
<b>We’re the evils of <i>justice,</i> meow! 
 We’re supposed to catch Pikachu, meow!</b>

09:10.400 --> 09:13.620
<b>I know that, but I can’t move...</b>

09:13.620 --> 09:15.990
<b>You can’t catch 
 on an empty stomach...</b>

09:15.990 --> 09:18.410
<b>Get it together, you gu—</b>

09:27.130 --> 09:30.220
<b>Bleh... Hurry and bite.</b>

09:30.800 --> 09:33.550
<b>Hurry and bite, 
 hurry and bite, hurry and bite...</b>

09:33.550 --> 09:35.720
<b>Ugh, can’t you be a little quieter?</b>

09:36.260 --> 09:37.720
<b>Aye, aye...</b>

09:37.720 --> 09:40.850
<b>He’s here! 
 He’s here, he’s here!</b>

09:40.850 --> 09:46.190
<b>This <i>has</i> to be Udeppou! 
 I <i>knew</i> he’d pick me!</b>

09:46.190 --> 09:50.440
<b>I’ll do a way better job looking after you 
 than Satoshi the battle freak!</b>

09:53.360 --> 09:57.160
<b>So come on out, 
 my beloved Udeppou!</b>

09:59.120 --> 10:01.120
<b>Oh! She hooked something, meow!</b>

10:02.120 --> 10:03.620
<b>Food?</b>

10:03.620 --> 10:05.080
<b>An Udeppou.</b>

10:05.080 --> 10:06.710
<b>Is that all...?</b>

10:07.460 --> 10:09.170
<b>What an arm...</b>

10:09.590 --> 10:11.090
<b>Oh, that looks tasty...</b>

10:11.090 --> 10:11.920
<b>Huh?!</b>

10:11.920 --> 10:13.680
<b>You noticed?</b>

10:13.680 --> 10:16.680
<b>Even if you snap its claw off, 
 it grows right back.</b>

10:16.680 --> 10:19.930
<b>The meat inside 
 is apparently a delicious delicacy.</b>

10:19.930 --> 10:21.310
<b>So it really is?!</b>

10:25.190 --> 10:27.310
<b>You’ve got guts, haven’t you?</b>

10:33.990 --> 10:36.660
<b>Huh?! N-N-N-No, stop!</b>

10:43.750 --> 10:44.830
<b><i>What?!</i></b>

10:44.830 --> 10:48.460
<b>You tried to hook Udeppou 
 but he hooked you instead!</b>

10:48.460 --> 10:49.800
<b>Gah!</b>

10:49.800 --> 10:51.710
<b>Like <i>you’ve</i> even hooked anything!</b>

10:51.710 --> 10:54.300
<b>This is it! 
 Come on, Udeppou!</b>

10:54.300 --> 10:55.970
<b>I’ll fish you up!</b>

10:58.640 --> 11:00.010
<b>All right!</b>

11:07.860 --> 11:10.320
<b>I’m not giving up!</b>

