11:34.590 --> 11:39.510
<b>Heigani</b>

11:34.590 --> 11:39.510
<b>Heigani</b>

11:34.590 --> 11:39.510
<b>Water</b>

11:34.590 --> 11:39.510
<b>m 0 0 m 1575 960 l 1830 960 l 1830 1024.5 l 1575 1024.5</b>

11:51.400 --> 11:53.280
<b>They’re talking about something.</b>

11:53.280 --> 11:55.320
<b>He wants me to catch him!</b>

11:56.110 --> 11:57.950
<b>Guess he didn’t agree.{~~Looks like your translation was off.~~}</b>

12:02.160 --> 12:03.080
<b>Huh?</b>

12:03.080 --> 12:04.450
<b>I’ve got it!</b>

12:04.450 --> 12:06.330
<b>He’s telling us to battle!</b>

12:06.790 --> 12:10.000
<b>We have a battle, 
 and whoever wins can catch him!</b>

12:14.050 --> 12:15.920
<b>So that’s it.</b>

12:17.300 --> 12:19.180
<b>Let’s battle, Kasumi!</b>

12:19.180 --> 12:22.010
<b>I can’t say no 
 to a good battle!</b>

12:22.010 --> 12:23.680
<b>Let’s do it!</b>

12:36.400 --> 12:37.780
<b>What, what, what?!</b>

12:38.570 --> 12:42.320
<b>If you ask us 
 “What, what, what?!”...</b>

12:43.280 --> 12:46.410
<b>We’ll answer out of 
 sympathy for the world...</b>

12:46.870 --> 12:49.540
<b>To protect the world from devastation...</b>

12:49.540 --> 12:52.420
<b>To preserve world peace...</b>

12:52.420 --> 12:55.420
<b>Championing the evils 
 of truth and love...</b>

12:55.420 --> 12:58.170
<b>We’re the lovely, charming villains...</b>

12:58.170 --> 12:59.340
<b>Musashi.</b>

12:59.340 --> 13:00.930
<b>Kojiro.</b>

13:00.930 --> 13:04.760
<b>The Team Rocket duo 
 soars through the galaxy...</b>

13:05.390 --> 13:09.810
<b>Like a white hole, 
 a white tomorrow awaits us...</b>

13:09.810 --> 13:12.150
<b>Just kidding, meow...</b>

13:14.940 --> 13:16.610
<b>Team Rocket!</b>

13:16.610 --> 13:18.320
<b>I couldn’t hear any of that.</b>

13:19.030 --> 13:20.950
<b>We’re starving...</b>

13:20.950 --> 13:25.830
<b>You’ve been gone for a long time, 
 eh, original brat girl?</b>

13:25.830 --> 13:29.160
<b>Forget that! 
 Let go of Udeppou!</b>

13:29.160 --> 13:31.710
<b>It’s not like it’s 
 <i>your</i> Pokémon, is it?!</b>

13:37.880 --> 13:41.220
<b>What we want is that Udeppou’s...</b>

13:41.930 --> 13:44.220
<b>...huge claw, meow!</b>

13:47.260 --> 13:48.350
<b>Claw?</b>

13:48.350 --> 13:51.810
<b>You <i>really</i> don’t 
 know <i>anything,</i> do you?</b>

13:51.810 --> 13:55.190
<b>Li’l Udeppou’s claw is a delicacy! 
 It’s supposed to be super tasty!</b>

13:55.190 --> 13:58.280
<b>We’ve found 
 our dinner for tonight!</b>

13:58.280 --> 13:59.610
<b>You’re gonna eat him?!</b>

14:00.400 --> 14:01.570
<b>Well, you heard ‘em.</b>

14:01.570 --> 14:04.360
<b>Once we’ve got the claw, 
 we’ll give the rest back, meow.</b>

14:04.740 --> 14:05.870
<b>You can’t!</b>

14:05.870 --> 14:09.290
<b>It’s fine. 
 It’ll grow straight back.</b>

14:09.290 --> 14:11.410
<b>Don’t you worry, 
 don’t you worry.</b>

14:11.410 --> 14:12.870
<b><i>Yeah, yeah!</i></b>

14:18.710 --> 14:20.460
<b>Good job, Heigani!</b>

14:28.180 --> 14:29.930
<b>Here they come! 
 Here they come!</b>

14:29.930 --> 14:31.930
<b>We’ve gotta get outta— 
 Huh? What?</b>

14:31.930 --> 14:35.150
<b>It’s hopeless... 
 I’m so hungry, I can’t move a muscle...</b>

14:35.150 --> 14:36.730
<b>I can’t move, meow...</b>

14:36.730 --> 14:37.940
<b>Come on!</b>

14:41.110 --> 14:43.860
<b><i>Udeppou!</i></b>

14:43.860 --> 14:46.780
<b>Amazing, Heigani, Udeppou!</b>

14:46.780 --> 14:48.830
<b>When you’re together, 
 nothing can stop you!</b>

14:53.250 --> 14:56.250
<b>Aww! I wanted to eat it!</b>

14:56.250 --> 14:59.550
<b>The sea is vast. 
 Plenty more Udeppou in the sea.</b>

14:59.550 --> 15:03.670
<b>I’ll take anything 
 as long as it fills me up, meow...</b>

15:03.670 --> 15:06.760
<b><i>What an awful feeling!</i></b>

15:12.640 --> 15:14.480
<b>The battle will be a 1v1.</b>

15:14.940 --> 15:17.350
<b>Whoever wins catches Udeppou.</b>

15:18.230 --> 15:19.860
<b>Watch this, Udeppou.</b>

15:19.860 --> 15:22.860
<b>The skill of the world-class beauty: 
 the tomboyish mermaid!</b>

15:23.320 --> 15:25.860
<b>Let’s go, my steady! {This specific wording hasn't come up in anything else we've subbed. M03 was いけ, SM042 was 出番よ, SM043 was いっけー, and SM102's two uses were おいで and 行っけ}</b>

15:28.870 --> 15:30.830
<b>Nyorotono, 
 I’m counting on you.</b>

15:32.120 --> 15:35.460
<b>Ooh! Nyorotono! 
 It looks happy!</b>

15:38.290 --> 15:40.380
<b>Now, Satoshi! 
 Who are you picking?</b>

15:42.800 --> 15:45.970
<b>Of course, Electric types are best 
 for dealing with Water types!</b>

15:45.970 --> 15:48.140
<b>...is what I’d like to say, but...</b>

15:48.140 --> 15:50.680
<b>Heigani, I choose you!</b>

15:54.430 --> 15:56.270
<b>Hang in there, Heigani.</b>

16:03.320 --> 16:06.820
<b>Hold it! Hold it! Why are you two 
 off in your own world?!</b>

16:06.820 --> 16:09.280
<b>They’re men! 
 They have a friendship of the fists!</b>

16:09.280 --> 16:11.330
<b>Hey, Udeppou!</b>

16:11.330 --> 16:14.290
<b>We’ve felt fate 
 pulling us together too, right?!</b>

16:17.040 --> 16:21.040
<b>Kyaah! 
 Those eyes, those eyes!</b>

16:21.460 --> 16:23.340
<b>Let’s get going already!</b>

16:23.340 --> 16:25.300
<b>We’re ready to go anytime!</b>

16:25.800 --> 16:28.930
<b>My Nyorotono 
 is fully prepared, too!</b>

16:32.180 --> 16:34.640
<b>Ooh, you’re gonna be the judge?</b>

16:34.640 --> 16:36.560
<b>I appreciate it, Pikachu!</b>

16:38.850 --> 16:40.690
<b>Let’s go! 
 Use Crabhammer!</b>

16:42.190 --> 16:43.520
<b>Bounce!</b>

16:51.200 --> 16:55.200
<b>What do you think? 
 These days, it’s the guardian deity of Hanada Gym!</b>

16:55.200 --> 16:57.080
<b>You okay, Heigani?</b>

16:57.830 --> 16:59.210
<b>Focus Blast!</b>

17:03.500 --> 17:04.590
<b>Metal Claw!</b>

17:12.800 --> 17:14.550
<b>All right, looking good!</b>

17:16.430 --> 17:18.480
<b>Follow up with Aqua Jet!</b>

17:23.690 --> 17:25.650
<b>Huh?! He’s so fast!</b>

17:29.070 --> 17:30.860
<b>Nyorotono, keep your cool!</b>

17:30.860 --> 17:32.320
<b>Dodge and use Hydro Pump!</b>

17:35.700 --> 17:37.410
<b>Ach... So close!</b>

17:40.160 --> 17:43.080
<b>Go up! 
 One more Aqua Jet!</b>

17:47.500 --> 17:48.380
<b>Huh?!</b>

17:48.760 --> 17:51.340
<b>Land the hit!</b>

18:01.810 --> 18:03.650
<b>Hang in there, Nyorotono!</b>

18:04.270 --> 18:06.650
<b>Let’s finish this! 
 Crabhammer!</b>

18:28.920 --> 18:30.300
<b>Huh?!</b>

18:32.300 --> 18:34.760
<b>Nyorotono, Megaton Punch!</b>

18:54.280 --> 18:58.870
<b>We did it, we did it, we did it, we did it! 
 Good job, Nyorotono!</b>

18:58.870 --> 19:00.540
<b>Heigani...</b>

19:07.170 --> 19:09.210
<b>You fought well, Heigani.</b>

19:13.220 --> 19:15.680
<b>There, there... I get it.</b>

19:16.090 --> 19:17.470
<b>You’re frustrated.</b>

19:19.300 --> 19:20.310
<b>Udeppou.</b>

19:20.760 --> 19:22.890
<b>I won the battle.</b>

19:22.890 --> 19:25.060
<b>I’m going to catch you.</b>

19:27.190 --> 19:28.940
<b>So come on, Udeppou!</b>

19:39.490 --> 19:41.740
<b>I caught Udeppou!</b>

19:44.960 --> 19:47.330
<b>This really was fate...</b>

19:47.330 --> 19:50.210
<b>Udeppou, I’ll treasure you...</b>

19:50.210 --> 19:52.420
<b>H-Huh?! What’s going on?!</b>

20:13.690 --> 20:17.150
<b>Awesome! 
 He’s giving him move training!</b>

20:18.450 --> 20:20.240
<b>Lemme join in!</b>

20:24.950 --> 20:27.460
<b><i>I’m</i> the one who caught him!</b>

20:27.460 --> 20:30.210
<b>Then why did we even 
 have a battle?</b>

20:36.720 --> 20:39.010
<b>My head hurts.</b>

20:53.020 --> 20:54.650
<b>I know you’re there.</b>

21:00.530 --> 21:02.160
<b>Why’re you following me?</b>

21:02.620 --> 21:04.490
<b>Huh? Um...</b>

21:04.490 --> 21:06.790
<b>Udeppou and Heigani 
 seemed to get along well,</b>

21:06.790 --> 21:10.370
<b>so I thought I’d let them 
 stay together for a bit longer.</b>

