23:41.320 --> 23:44.820
<b>Following an order 
 to catch new Pokémon...</b>

23:44.820 --> 23:47.660
<b>...we made our first visit 
 to the Paldea Region.</b>

23:47.660 --> 23:50.030
<b>Oh, meow? 
 There’s one, meow!</b>

23:50.490 --> 23:52.790
<b>Hmm... It’s not in here.</b>

23:52.790 --> 23:53.660
<b>Which means...</b>

23:54.620 --> 23:55.910
<b>Look! There’s another one!</b>

23:56.290 --> 23:57.790
<b>All right!</b>

23:58.540 --> 23:59.920
<b>That’s it, meow!</b>

23:59.920 --> 24:02.300
<b>The Legendary Pokémon, 
 Miraidon.</b>

24:02.670 --> 24:05.670
<b>It says it’ll be an amazing Pokémon 
 forevermore!</b>

24:05.670 --> 24:08.300
<b>All right, let’s catch it quick!</b>

24:08.300 --> 24:08.800
<b>Yeah!</b>

24:18.600 --> 24:20.900
<b><i>What an awful feeling!</i></b>

24:24.320 --> 24:25.740
<b>Today’s roundup:</b>

24:25.740 --> 24:26.900
<b>Miraidon is...</b>

24:26.900 --> 24:28.240
<b>...futuristic!</b>

24:28.240 --> 24:30.370
<b></b>Futuristic
